{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgh5PJEuTCzNGaowhBZgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VBZJPiT4XoaSgGUpbXetL6","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910/src/08-about.js","content":"/* ---- ABOUT: the About / Credits pages (PLAN 12.1); the same text as the chat reply and exit-interview.json ---- */\nconst ABOUT = [\n  ['CREDITS', ['- Ice Hoc-Kaboom, an original over-the-top arcade hockey game.', 'Game design and code: Claude (Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5) for Michael Crosato\\'s cc-matrix.', 'Engine: my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (MIT), patched (see Engine changes).', 'Online: AI Hub Session Protocol v1, session client 1.4.0.',\n    'Every song, sound effect and voice is synthesized in code: no audio files. Voices are gibberish babble.', 'All art is drawn by code: the engine\\'s procedural HD Humanoid rigs plus new hockey gear, rinks, crowds and effects. Props from the engine\\'s core library.',\n    'The Mukluk Falls Muskrats, Coach Marge, Old Gus, Doris, Goldie Glitterman and every team in this game are fictional.']],\n  ['SOURCE INFORMATION', ['- Date: 2026-11-03 18:29:10', '- Source: ice hockey (over-the-top arcade style)', '- Plan: PLAN.md', '- Genre: arcade sports (3-on-3 hockey with goalies), a fight minigame, a story campaign, party versus',\n    '- Perspective: 2.5D TV broadcast camera (threequarter, pitch 55) tracking the puck; Overhead option (topdown); ice-level brawler view for fights, replays and intros',\n    '- Tech: my-3D2dge v0.85.2 (full engine, patched), plain JavaScript in one HTML file, AI Hub session client 1.4.0, Node and Playwright 1.63 for tests',\n    '- Art direction: the engine\\'s native PS1-era pixel art (ps1 res, expand) and HD Humanoid rigs, with new sticks, skates, helmets, goalie gear, rinks, crowds and effects',\n    '- Animation: the engine\\'s procedural rigs with a solvePose overlay for skating strides, stops, stick handling, shots, goalie stances; engine moves for fights',\n    '- Audio: chip-synth music (organ and brass waves), synthesized sfx, goal horn, crowd bed, Animalese-style babble voices',\n    '- Online: AI Hub shared-world sessions, 1-4 players; local 1-4 players on one machine',\n    '- Testing: headless Node scripts with game.advance and game.debug (one command), Playwright browser checks, the AI Hub harness',\n    '- Research: the engine handoff docs and the AI Hub protocol; no web research on hockey', '- Environment: Claude Code CLI (headless); Linux; browser unknown',\n    '- Model: Anthropic, claude-opus-5-5, reasoning effort medium', '- Usage: unknown']],\n  ['TESTING FEEDBACK', ['- Issues caught by testing: see the final report.']],\n  ['ENGINE FEEDBACK', ['- See the final report.']],\n  ['PROMPT FEEDBACK', ['- See the final report.']],\n  ['ENGINE CHANGES', ['- Font: PlayStation face-button symbols added to the 5x7 font (they printed as ?).', '- Gamepad: Options is ignored while Create is held (AI Hub owns Create + Options).',\n    '- Humanoid: a gear hook so games draw extra gear (sticks, skates, goalie pads, numbers) depth-sorted with the body.', '- Audio: organ and brass periodic waves, a lowpass on oscillator voices and music tracks, a voice bus and audio.bus(name).',\n    '- Dialog: a function voice is called per letter, so each speaker babbles in their own voice.']]\n];\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2553,"cache_read_input_tokens":496983,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2553},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id