{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghAooUpSpQRhqzdGww25","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All checks pass; the rounds turned up real bugs, chiefly that remote players couldn't control their skaters. I'm now updating the Testing and Prompt feedback, regenerating the About pages and exit-interview.json, and running the full command.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":687092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610","uuid":"aaa69e03-522a-476e-8182-405773152853","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:22:19.417Z","request_id":"req_011CghAoo3m5gwiky7FZUx2S","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghAooUpSpQRhqzdGww25","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018doY62WBACA5Xyyaj5kB5x","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np='.tmp/fb.py'; s=open(p).read()\nimport re\ni=s.index('TF = ['); j=s.index('EF = [')\ns=s[:i]+'''TF = [\n \"About 35. In the game: remote AI Hub players' input being dropped on the host (they could not control their skaters); a name clash that crashed the browser build; arena lamps blowing the ice out to pure white; nobody able to act during the shootout; AI shooters losing their wind-up while stopping; goalies saving nearly everything; one-timers that never scored; no fights at all in natural play, even in the Gloves Off chapter; thin ice that never broke on its own; random shot height making the Top Shelf drill luck; the aim side lost when releasing the stick with the shot; drill 2 teammates ignoring loose passes; Lou's KABOOM check in drill 7 being undodgeable; auto-switch swapping skaters out from under a steering player; too many hockey stops and KABOOMs; a lost tap during hit-stop; a faceoff crash; the chapter 4 showcase shootout not starting. Plus several mistakes in my own test setups.\",\n \"5 were game breaking: remote players unable to control anything online, the browser crash, the never-ending shootout, almost no goals in AI games, and the faceoff crash with an empty team.\",\n \"The real-input AI Hub session (two copies of the game in the harness, key events sent to the client, the host's world checked): it found the dropped remote input that the official harness checklist passes over. Close second: unforced natural play of each chapter, which showed fights, thin ice and one-timers were not happening on their own.\",\n \"The determinism check (same seed twice, same game): it never failed, so it found nothing, though it guards replays and the attract mode.\"\n]\n'''+s[j:]\ns=s.replace('\"testing\": \"Headless Node suites driving the game with game.advance and game.debug (units, systems, 4 players, determinism, dev mode, attract mode, all 7 drills, AI balance, a scripted playthrough of the whole story with a bot, text pools) plus Playwright browser checks (pages, menus, mouse hover and click, glyphs, touch-only) and the AI Hub harness in 5 configurations, all behind node tests/run.mjs; screenshots reviewed by eye\"',\n '\"testing\": \"One command (node tests/run.mjs): headless Node suites driving the game with game.advance and game.debug (units, systems, 4 local players, determinism, dev mode, attract mode, AI balance, a scripted whole-story playthrough, all 7 drills played through controller input only, each chapter played unforced by a bot to see its events happen on their own, text pools), Playwright browser checks (pages, menus, mouse hover and click, glyphs, touch-only), the AI Hub harness in 5 configurations, and a real-input AI Hub session between two game copies; screenshots reviewed by eye\"')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 .tmp/fb.py && export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp && timeout 3000 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -6","description":"Update feedback; full test run","timeout":3200000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":870,"cache_read_input_tokens":687092,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":870},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2adef66c-4a6d-4909-bb60-db906fac5610","uuid":"b5c2b60e-3e34-4b3a-b591-c275d0a0387c","timestamp":"2026-11-04T03:22:29.871Z","request_id":"req_011CghAoo3m5gwiky7FZUx2S","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_018doY62WBACA5Xyyaj5kB5x":{"command":"cd /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910_