nce, a scripted playthrough of the whole story with a bot, text pools) plus Playwright browser checks (pages, menus, mouse hover and click, glyphs, touch-only) and the AI Hub harness in 5 configurations, all behind node tests/run.mjs; screenshots reviewed by eye\"',\n '\"testing\": \"One command (node tests/run.mjs): headless Node suites driving the game with game.advance and game.debug (units, systems, 4 local players, determinism, dev mode, attract mode, AI balance, a scripted whole-story playthrough, all 7 drills played through controller input only, each chapter played unforced by a bot to see its events happen on their own, text pools), Playwright browser checks (pages, menus, mouse hover and click, glyphs, touch-only), the AI Hub harness in 5 configurations, and a real-input AI Hub session between two game copies; screenshots reviewed by eye\"')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\npython3 .tmp/fb.py && export TMPDIR=$PWD/.tmp && timeout 3000 node tests/run.mjs 2>&1 | tail -6","description":"Update feedback; full test run","timeout":3200000}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_018doY62WBACA5Xyyaj5kB5x":{"cwd":"/home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-medium.build__20261103-182910__x9a2bbb/work/IceHoc-Kaboom-IceHockey-claude-opus-5-5-medium-20261103-182910"}}}
